To simplify further the model cluster, we replaced the benzene rings from the bdc linkers by hydrogen atoms (Fig. 3).   Similar to the oxo-centered trimer, the MIL-53 type SBU has an overall charge of $+1$ that was neglected in the UFF calculations, but considered in the DFT calculations (see Supporting Information).
